          "text": "An SSD still remembers your files."
        },
        {
          "id": "cell-trap",
          "scene": "cell",
          "text": "Inside each flash cell, a special region can trap electrical charge."
        },
        {
          "id": "cell-state",
          "scene": "cell",
          "text": "The amount of charge changes the cell's threshold voltage."
        },
        {
          "id": "read-test",
          "scene": "read",
          "text": "To read it, the controller applies a test voltage and checks whether the cell conducts."
        },
        {
          "id": "read-value",
          "scene": "read",
          "text": "That response reveals the stored value."
        },
        {
          "id": "organize-pages",
          "scene": "organize",
          "text": "Billions of cells are organized into pages and blocks."
        },
        {
          "id": "wear-limit",
          "scene": "wear",
          "text": "Writing gradually wears the insulating material that holds the charge."
        },
        {
          "id": "wear-spread",
          "scene": "wear",
          "text": "So the controller spreads new writes across different cells, a process called wear leveling."
        },
        {
          "id": "closing-summary",
          "scene": "closing",
          "text": "Trapped charge preserves the data, while careful reading and wear leveling keep the SSD useful."
        }
